  "title": "Arizer Air & Solo Combo Pack",
  "description": "Combo Pack of Accessories for your Air V1, Air II, Solo V1 and Solo II\n\nSolo Kit Includes:\n1* 110MM Straight Tube\n1* Curved Tube\n4* Wooden Cleaning Sticks\n4* Flat Screens\n2* Zeus Grime Sticks\n2* Zeus Grime Wipe\n1* Cleaning Brush\n\nAir Kit Includes:\n2* 70MM Straight Tube\n4* Wooden Cleaning Sticks\n4* Flat Screens\n2* Zeus Grime Sticks\n2* Zeus Grime Wipes\n1* Cleaning Brush\n\nThe mesh screens are only needed for finely ground plant material. If it is not finely ground, you can just insert the material into the glass tube without a screen. The screens are made out of high grade stainless steel material.\n\nSaveSaveSaveSaveSave",
  "description_html": "<p><span style=\"font-size: small\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial\">Combo Pack of Accessories for your Air V1, Air II, Solo V1 and Solo II</p>\n<p>Solo Kit Includes:<br />1* 110MM Straight Tube<br />1* Curved Tube<br />4* Wooden Cleaning Sticks<br />4* Flat Screens<br />2* Zeus Grime Sticks<br />2* Zeus Grime Wipe</span></span><span style=\"font-size: small\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial\"><br />1* Cleaning Brush</p>\n<p>Air Kit Includes:<br />2* 70MM Straight Tube<br />4* Wooden Cleaning Sticks<br />4* Flat Screens<br />2* Zeus Grime Sticks<br />2* Zeus Grime Wipes <br />1* Cleaning Brush</p>\n<p> The mesh screens are only needed for finely ground plant material. If it is not finely ground, you can just insert the material into the glass tube without a screen. </span></span><span style=\"font-size: small\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial\">The screens are made out of high grade stainless steel material.</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"border-radius: 2px;text-indent: 20px;width: auto;padding: 0px 4px 0px 0px;text-align: center;font: bold 11px/20px &apos;Helvetica Neue&apos;,Helvetica,sans-serif;color: #ffffff;background: #bd081c  no-repeat scroll 3px 50% / 14px 14px;position: absolute;opacity: 1;z-index: 8675309;display: none;cursor: pointer\">Save</span><span style=\"border-radius: 2px;text-indent: 20px;width: auto;padding: 0px 4px 0px 0px;text-align: center;font: bold 11px/20px &apos;Helvetica Neue&apos;,Helvetica,sans-serif;color: #ffffff;background: #bd081c  no-repeat scroll 3px 50% / 14px 14px;position: absolute;opacity: 1;z-index: 8675309;display: none;cursor: pointer\">Save</span><span style=\"border-radius: 2px;text-indent: 20px;width: auto;padding: 0px 4px 0px 0px;text-align: center;font: bold 11px/20px &apos;Helvetica Neue&apos;,Helvetica,sans-serif;color: #ffffff;background: #bd081c  no-repeat scroll 3px 50% / 14px 14px;position: absolute;opacity: 1;z-index: 8675309;display: none;cursor: pointer\">Save</span><span style=